      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "Note"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "LOCAL-ONLY IMAGE + REFERENCE-VIDEO REPLACEMENT, adapted from the HearmemanAI MiniMax Reference Pack workflow.\nUpload one or more subject images plus a performance/scene video in MiniMax References Manager. The video can contribute action, body motion, camera, environment and its soundtrack. H3 generates a new video.\nPrompt writing is LOCAL ONLY through Ollama at http://127.0.0.1:11434/v1. Full uses the existing 32B Instruct analysis model; Lite is rewritten at install time to the existing 8B Instruct model. OpenRouter and hosted model selection are disabled in the baked node pack. No API key is required or read.\nStart with Draft only. The Reference Pack analyzes sampled local video frames, not the soundtrack, and writes the H3 prompt. H3 itself still receives the full prepared video frames and enabled video soundtrack as native references. Then switch only the review node to Generate video.\nFull defaults to High fidelity, 25 steps, res_multistep/simple, BF16 H3 and ref_image_size=max. Lite uses the existing INT8 full-architecture H3 stack with a lower-memory default. 9:16, 2:3 and 16:9 are supported.\nIdentity competition is still possible because the reference video pixels are true H3 visual conditioning. This is a generative replacement workflow, not a frame-exact face swap. Use clean, consistent identity images and a short reference clip.\nGenerated audio is conditioned by the reference audio but is not a bit-identical copy. For voice reuse, leave the reference video soundtrack enabled and describe the requested dialogue in the direction field.\nBased on Hearmeman24/ComfyUI-MiniMaxRefPack 0.3.5 pinned at 7012734eabf6f98063d6eaf8ce1f9264ee803664. Requires the 1.5.2 H3 Portrait image rebuild."
      ]
    }
  ],
